Our system has two doors: a left door and a right door. Both of them can be open or closed.
 
Write a data structure that holds the open/closed information for both doors.
Provide a way to see if both doors are currently closed.




enum door_state {
	close = 0;
	open = 1;
	unknown;
}

struct doors{
	door_state left = 0;
	door_state right = 0;	
}


// check if both are open or not

bool isOpen(*doors1)
{
	
	return (doors1.left & doors1.right)
}